stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Intent
  Intent --> Specification: defines contract
  Specification --> WorkBlock: scopes implementation
  WorkBlock --> Implementation: approved work
  Implementation --> LocalVerification: checks behavior
  LocalVerification --> PullRequest: reviewable change
  PullRequest --> CIAndCodeQL: required analysis
  CIAndCodeQL --> MergeGate: checks complete
  MergeGate --> Merge: allowed
  MergeGate --> PullRequest: blocked or changes requested
  Merge --> PostMergeState: canonical transition
  PostMergeState --> [*]
